  "description": "Description Technology What's in the Box\n\nDescription\n\nStep into a new adventure with the Lectric XP Step-Thru 2.0! The Step-Thru frame allows you to easily step into the bike rather than swing your foot over the top. At its core, the Step-Thru 2.0 is still the same award-winning bike, but with twice the experience. Here’s a breakdown of everything we added to the 2.0:\n\nVariable front oil suspension for exceptional shock absorption\nMounting points for racks, baskets, and a bike lock\n3-inch tires for heightened agility\nWider handlebars, allowing you to add mirrors, phone holders, and have a more comfortable riding position\nStellar new paint job\nIP-65 rated electrical components for greater water and dust resistance – so you can conquer the elements\n\n*Range may vary based on weight load, terrain, weather, and other factors.\n\nBrakes:\n\nTektro 160mm mechanical disc brakes\n\nTires:\n\nChaoyang or CST 3\" x 20\" Fat tires\n\nClassification:\n\nClass 2 Electric Bike on shipment (limited to 20mph)\nCan be changed to Class 3 via the display (limited to 28mph)\n\n*Bike will come with CST or Chaoyang tires (CST Pictured)",
